{{JPExclusive}}
'''Ultraman Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked when beating [[Shin Japan Heroes Universe Collaboration Event#Rescue! Ultraman Cat|Rescue! Ultraman Cat]]. It was added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 704
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Ultraman Cat
|name2 = Shin Ultraman Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Shin Ultraman Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
During the early game, this unit may be of some use against Dark enemies such as [[Doge Dark]], though such situations are sparse in the early game. After that, however, his single target and mediocre-at-best stats keep him from seeing any serious use outside of the [[Underground Labyrinth]].

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

